  "assembly_notes": "Six independent component slots form 192 complete structural combinations. The selected grinding radius and profile derive the central trough relief, grinding bed opening, feed throat, bearing span, cheek bore height and outlet path. The body remains a long wooden trough in every combination. The three-joint chain is mill_body -> adjustable_bearing (Z prismatic) -> grinding_shaft (Y continuous) -> hand_grip (Y continuous), with all joints solved and registered from AxisInterface mates. Real bores and radial/axial clearances replace all overlap allowances.",
